  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/99c773054f24237390ab8cc2697bdea6.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">YezNatural&trade; is an Africa-inspired ethical health and food brand &amp; social business.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Our vision is to bring Africa's natural nutrient-rich ingredients to the world.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Experience the Incredible Benefits of Our Natural Health Boosting Superfoods</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Eating healthy and nutritious foods is essential for optimal health and well-being. Our Natural Health Boosting Superfoods are packed with vitamins, minerals, antioxidants, and other nutrients that can help promote overall health and vitality. These superfoods provide the body with essential nutrients and incredible benefits such as improved immunity, better digestion, increased energy levels, and more.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Freshly Sundried Organic Spices &amp; Herbs Directly From the Mother Africa</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Discover the incredible benefits of freshly sundried organic spices and herbs directly from Mother Africa. Enjoy these natural ingredients' unique flavour and aroma, harvested from their native soil for centuries. With no additives or preservatives, you can trust that you are getting the freshest product possible. Experience the unique taste and texture of these organic spices and herbs as they bring out the best flavours in your dishes. Join this growing trend today and enjoy all the health benefits that come with using fresh, organic ingredients sourced directly from Mother Africa!</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">SOCIAL IMPACT</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Our revitalising, natural ingredients are sustainably sourced from low-income rural farmers. So every purchase makes a positive impact on their daily livelihood.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Trust in the goodness of our nutrient-rich natural ingredients sustainably sourced from low-income rural farmers in Africa.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">By sourcing nutrient-rich natural ingredients from low-income rural farmers in Africa, we are able to trust in the goodness of our products and make sure that we are helping to sustain the livelihoods of those most in need. Not only are we able to provide these farmers with a sustainable source of income, but we can also ensure that the ingredients used in our products are of the highest quality and packed with essential nutrients. This is why we have chosen to source our natural ingredients from low-income rural farmers in Africa: because it allows us to trust in their goodness and know that it is making a positive impact on their lives.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Mindset is a big part of the YezNatural&trade; brand philosophy. People are seeking more avenues for inspiration and encouragement every day. So our branding &amp; slogan of 'YEZ' was created to invoke positivity as we champion a positive and improved lifestyle for our suppliers and consumers.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">PLASTIC FREE PACKAGING</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">We currently use e</span>nvironmentally friendly, fully compostable and biodegradable Re-sealable pouches&nbsp;manufactured to EU packaging legislation.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p>",
